    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2004-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Rows \\(12\\) through \\(22\\) inclusive make up \\(22 - 12 + 1 = 11\\) rows.\n\nEach row has \\(33\\) seats, so the total is \\(33 \\times 11 = 363.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
